# 统一行尾：仓库内一律存 LF，工作区也保持 LF（本工作区跨 Windows/WSL 共用，
# 依赖 core.autocrlf 会在一侧产生全量脏文件，因此显式写死 eol=lf）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：禁止任何行尾/编码转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.dds  binary
*.otf  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.node binary
